				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Struggling a bit with names for the things I think I might need to model the wiki codebase. I guess the group of lib files is a package. And the individual files are modules. And the package likely wants to know about the package.json. The build affordances can be called scripts. Maybe these are domain entities for any javascript project. But I don't want to think quite that generally. These are meant to be custom tools molded to work with federated wiki.\n\nI'm going to want to know about `require` vs `import` directives. And maybe static vs dynamic."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
